# Kept deliberately: this is the only grant for init to create the sockets
# declared in vendor/etc/init/mtk_agpsd.rc (agpsd/agpsd2/agpsd3), and the stock
# kpoc_charger.rc "on charger" path needs socket bring-up intact. Android 10
# platform policy dropped this grant; the common MTK policy does not restore it.
# Restore the stock 8.1 rule; first-OTA denials were init -> socket_device:sock_file
# { create } for agpsd/agpsd2/agpsd3.
allow init socket_device:sock_file { create setattr unlink };
